  "content": "🚀 Cursor Estonia Hackathon\n\nToday I joined the Cursor Estonia Hackathon — a fun and fast-paced afternoon hackathon right here in Tallinn! 🎉\n\nI showcased my Tetris AI project, and it was awesome to share it with fellow makers and see their reactions. 🤖🧩\n\n\n\nAnd of course... the food deserves a special mention. The truffle pizza was absolutely delicious! 🍕✨",
